    description: "FOUND 2026-10-25 (premise check of META-sigap), fixture only.\n\nScala emits no construction edge of any type -- not instantiates, not calls -- for `new Local()` where `class Local` is defined in the same repository, and none for an external `new File(...)`. java, csharp, php and typescript each emit instantiates for the in-repo case on the same fixture shape, so the scala gap is not a fixture artefact. Consequence: a Scala class constructed only via `new` looks unreferenced (dead-code false positive) and its constructor-side effects are unreachable in slices.\n\nIn-repo half is this item; the external half is WI-jubag. Not measured on a corpus; scala 3 `Local()` universal-apply syntax not checked."  # 7c19
    fields: {}  # 7c19
